# title: Worker that recharges and continues
# description: Digs a tunnel, and whenever its power gets low it remembers the spot, walks to the charger, recharges, walks back to exactly that spot and carries on.
# Setup: stand the robot on a charger, facing the rock, and start it. The charger waypoint
# is where it starts. If the charger is somewhere else, move the robot there and use
# Save here in the Waypoints tab with the name "charger". The robot needs to find its way
# back through the tunnel it dug (Hover Upgrade if it hovers).
use waypoint

# --- settings ---
set goal = 120
set low_power = 25
set full_power = 95

# the charger: save it only when it is not saved yet
set known = call waypoint.has "charger"
if not known
  call waypoint.save "charger"

set done = 0
loop done < goal
  if battery_level < low_power
    # remember where the work stopped and which way I faced
    call waypoint.save "work"
    call waypoint.go_face "charger"
    loop battery_level < full_power
      wait 100
    call waypoint.go_face "work"
  dig front
  move forward
  if not ok
    break
  add done 1

call waypoint.go_face "charger"
chat "Finished: " + done + " blocks"
